        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.9rem'>\n    <div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:3rem;line-height:1;\n                  font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:#1b1c1e\">\n        34.7 in</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:0.875rem;color:#5d5e61;\n                  max-width:30rem;margin-top:0.35rem\">\n        at the tightest point of this trip, measured between the two pieces the scan found there. 36 in is the minimum.\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div style=\"font-size:0.9375rem;color:#5d5e61;max-width:32rem\">\n      <p style=\"color:#1b1c1e;margin:0 0 0.4rem\">\n        2 checks measured something and asked for another\n        look rather than ruling on it.\n      </p>\n      <ul style=\"margin:0 0 0.5rem;padding-left:1.1rem\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:0.2rem\">There is nowhere to pass another customer<span style=\"color:#8a8a88\"> \u2014 Point the phone at the sofa again</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom:0.2rem\">The path is too narrow<span style=\"color:#8a8a88\"> \u2014 Point the phone at the sofa again</span></li></ul>\n      <p style=\"margin:0\">Turn the switch on to see what they would have said.</p>\n    </div>\n    </div>"
